      "kind": "reader",
      "lessonKey": "foundation:8"
    },
    {
      "text": "私は肉を食べません。トムは乳製品を食べません。",
      "textSha256": "0587f29b5122ed5fffe5215b41c700657d263e717b01b0e2a9675bd668acb4d8",
      "placementId": "foundation-travel-breakfast:8:ja-en:reader:source-scene-v1:meat-and-dairy",
      "placementSha256": "c2fd7cb2a11512e83b8ca567d0cdc6f6aedef82de4a7febd1af56d3bf76fe79c",
      "kind": "reader",
      "lessonKey": "foundation:8"
    },
    {
      "text": "ピーナッツは絶対に食べません。アレルギーがあります。",
      "textSha256": "daf8e27d2e53d724c02e095e8001122e58b6bb334dec6e1ca02f0339c03a092e",
      "placementId": "foundation-travel-breakfast:8:ja-en:reader:source-scene-v1:peanut-allergy",
      "placementSha256": "60f01dfc1c3733ba8705c966c13f0599a1f16ad64a754c00fa26410395f75071",
      "kind": "reader",
      "lessonKey": "foundation:8"
    },
    {
      "text": "厨房でナッツ類やピーナッツを使っているか確認します。",
      "textSha256": "1788a582b83875ad44f529db55a5f1d7aeeb0ba22058b617d8df473040113dea",
      "placementId": "foundation-travel-breakfast:8:ja-en:reader:source-scene-v1:ask-kitchen",
      "placementSha256": "40ea33e0aa311cb62c2d19f8af4ba804e4211fdc0209fe78007b0491ae08a77a",
      "kind": "reader",
      "lessonKey": "foundation:8"
    },
    {
      "text": "クリームもチーズも入っていない緑のチラキレスには、肉も乳製品も入っていません。",
      "textSha256": "9807897f44ac4fb513682e107cc9f8b794b1baa8ffe1b9ea3f0ddfa86a49ba1c",
      "placementId": "foundation-travel-breakfast:8:ja-en:reader:source-scene-v1:chilaquiles",
